# NOTICE

## Upstream content

Everything under `agents/`, `prompts/` and `skills/` is a **byte-identical copy**
of resources bundled with the macOS **Agent Deck** application:

- Source: https://github.com/a-streetcoder/agent-deck
- Paths: `agent-deck/bundled-agents`, `agent-deck/bundled-prompts`, `agent-deck/bundled-skills`
- Commit: see `upstream.lock.json` (`commit`, plus a SHA-256 per file)
- License: MIT (see the upstream repository)

These files are not modified in this repository. Verification:

```bash
npm run verify:fidelity   # local copies vs the hashes in upstream.lock.json
npm run verify:upstream   # the same, checked against the live upstream files
```

## Original work in this repository

Only the packaging and the pi integration are original to this project:

- `package.json` — pi package manifest
- `extensions/index.ts` — seeder, supervisor surfacing, `/route`, `/agentdeck`
- `extensions/supervisor.ts` — a pi implementation of the app's `contact_supervisor` tool
- `models.json` — per-agent model/tier overlay
- `prompts-pi/`, `skills-pi/` — pi-native prompt templates and skills
- `scripts/`, `.github/workflows/`, documentation

